EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR_ANON_KEY
# Local Supabase (HTTP + anon from `supabase status -o env`):
#   iOS Simulator / web on same machine → http://127.0.0.1:54321
#   Android Emulator → http://10.0.2.2:54321 (host loopback)
#   Physical phone/tablet → http://<YOUR_MAC_LAN_IP>:54321 (same Wi‑Fi; not 127.0.0.1)
#
# Hosted Supabase — magic links / email redirect (Dashboard → Authentication → URL Configuration):
#   Site URL: sproutly://auth-callback   (or your production web URL later)
#   Redirect URLs (add each line; wildcards need ** for paths):
#     sproutly://auth-callback
#     sproutly://**
#     exp://**
#     https://auth.expo.io/**
#   If you change local `supabase/config.toml` auth URLs, run `supabase stop && supabase start`.
